    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Civics Scribble</i> is a web-based line drawing game designed to challenge players with questions inspired by the U.S. Naturalization Exam. Make your way through 96 levels across nine scenic locations based on real-life state and National Parks. You will test your knowledge of U.S. Civics while drawing lines for the inquisitive Mr. Apple to roll on or bounce off of to navigate challenges such as spikes, bouncy blocks and teleporters. <i>Civics Scribble</i> merges the styles of both classic retro games like <i>The Oregon Trail</i> and modern ones like <i>Minecraft</i> and <i>Roblox</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793300/extras/624f66ae18097a9c0f16173bd35c36fb.avif?t=1751295405\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793300/extras/decc67f38a005ed3a9ec50fa2e795c60.avif?t=1751295405\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793300/extras/7cd1aa088464954a98ded02836b9142f.avif?t=1751295405\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Civics Scribble</i> is a web-based line drawing game designed to challenge players with questions inspired by the U.S. Naturalization Exam. Make your way through 96 levels across nine scenic locations based on real-life state and National Parks. You will test your knowledge of U.S. Civics while drawing lines for the inquisitive Mr. Apple to roll on or bounce off of to navigate challenges such as spikes, bouncy blocks and teleporters. <i>Civics Scribble</i> merges the styles of both classic retro games like <i>The Oregon Trail</i> and modern ones like <i>Minecraft</i> and <i>Roblox</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793300/extras/624f66ae18097a9c0f16173bd35c36fb.avif?t=1751295405\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793300/extras/decc67f38a005ed3a9ec50fa2e795c60.avif?t=1751295405\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793300/extras/7cd1aa088464954a98ded02836b9142f.avif?t=1751295405\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
